  "description": "Verify that the system validates a coupon code against supported coupons and subtotal-before-shipping eligibility rules, does not apply any discount for an invalid or ineligible coupon code, keeps cart and order totals unchanged, handles the invalid entry gracefully in the UI, and clearly indicates that the coupon was not applied.",
  "priority": "critical",
